        cheaper, above it FCL starts to win (LOW-confidence rule of thumb). Ask the forwarder to itemise
        freight, surcharges, THC, documentation, inspection, clearance, EU duty, 20% VAT, the inland
        gateway-to-Vienna leg and delivery on the same quote so the price is comparable across modes.
      </div>
