      and Xiamen provide northern/southeast alternatives. The destination side is different from every
      other European country page: Austria has <strong>no seaport</strong>, so the "destination port"
      decision is really a <strong>transit-gateway decision</strong>, with Vienna (ATVIE) as the inland
      Danube terminal and rail hub where the cargo finally clears and delivers.
    </p>

